# Training artifacts — ignored in template/ and all models/*/
**/data/raw/
**/data/processed/
**/checkpoints/
**/logs/

# Inference-only helper data (large, user-downloaded or auto-generated;
# never committed). See PROJECT_SUMMARY.md → Opt-in inference helpers.
# Syzygy 3-4-5 tablebases (~1 GB)
**/data/syzygy/
# Polyglot opening book (~10 MB)
**/data/book.bin
# Cross-game MCTS transposition cache (grows)
**/data/mcts_cache.json
**/data/mcts_cache.json.tmp
# Syzygy table files (belt-and-suspenders in case syzygy/ moves)
*.rtbw
*.rtbz

# Python
